=== layout: one-panel

# Chromosome corpus review

@body

- 68 current figures from across the genetics lectures.
- Use the C-number when commenting: "C12: keep ..., change ...".
- Compare body shape, centromere, outline, color, labels, and density.
- Choose features you like; different biological states may need different forms.
- Photos and evidence maps are labeled as references.
- This collection awaits your critique; inclusion does not imply approval.

@notes

Review snapshot: November 16, 2026. Figures are reused unchanged. Source numbers refer to expanded source/ODP slide order, including hidden slides. Full source paths and SHA-256 hashes are in chromosome_samples.csv.

